<title>USA: Apertus says proceeds may help Q4 results.</title>
<headline>Apertus says proceeds may help Q4 results.</headline>
<dateline>EDEN PRAIRIE, Minn. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apertus Technologies Inc said Tuesday that proceeds from sale of a product line may allow the company to report a profitable fourth quarter.</p>
<p>&quot;The gain on the sale of MQView will provide the flexibility to report a positive net income in Apertus' fourth quarter ending March 1997,&quot; said Robert Gordon, chairman, president, and chief executive officer.</p>
</text>
